    "meta_cup_turfaccess-alt_description": "Our current approach is not fast enough. We have to take the risk and face the soldiers occupying the turf head on.",
    "meta_cup_buytrucks_description": "Our efforts in the gold depot will be worth nothing if we can't get the gold home. We'll need several trucks capable of handling the heavy load.",
    "meta_cup_hideincrates_description": "Our time has come and we're going for the gold of the King of Rockay City. We hide inside the containers at the harbor that will soon head to the gold depot. No one will suspect a thing.",
    "meta_cup_distraction-policestation_title": "Police Disruption",
