    "meta_cup_depotrecon1_title": "Security Inspection",
    "meta_cup_digtunnel_task": "Send soldiers to dig a tunnel to the depot",
    "meta_cup_depotrecon1_description": "Sheriff Norris is about to make a security inspection of the gold depot. Nasara has managed to bribe one of the janitors, and we may be able to get some intel on what their weak spot is.",
    "meta_cup_dragondefense_description": "Sicarios have put together an exceptional strike force to push us out of this turf. We can't let them screw us.",
    "meta_cup_storage-c4_objective": "Steal crates with explosives",
    "meta_cup_distraction-policestation_description": "The SWAT team can be a pain in the ass when we break into the gold depot. By secretly sabotaging their vehicles, we can slow them down and buy us more time.",
    "meta_cup_hostagedistraction_description": "The cops can be a nuisance when we break into the gold depot. We'll keep them busy by staging a hostage crisis in the bank.",
    "meta_cup_digtunnel_description": "The gold depot is a fortress with no easy access. We have to make our own way to get all the gold home.",
    "meta_cup_goldcup-glider_description": "The gold depot may be a fortress, but the sky is the only limit for us. We'll land the gliders on the roof and get the King's gold as the crow flies.",
    "meta_cup_hireglider_description": "The only way to get into this fortress of a gold depot is from above. The airspace around is monitored, but no one would suspect a glider, right?",
    "meta_cup_cemetery_description": "To gain access to the gold, we will visit the former King of Rockay City in his crypt in the cemetery and ask him to lend us a helping hand.",
    "meta_cup_digtunnel_title": "Tunnel to the Depot",
    "meta_cup_depotrecon2_title": "Undercover",
    "meta_cup_hideincrates_title": "Unexpected Shipment",
    "meta_cup_digtunnel2_task": "Wait for the tunnel to be dug",
    "meta_cup_storage-c4_description": "We are in need of a large amount of explosives, and there may be a high quality boom makers in this guarded warehouse.",
    "meta_cup_depotrecon2_description": "We found out that there are regular shipments from the harbor to the gold depot. If we can get the container numbers of the next shipment, we can use them to infiltrate the basement. Because of the sensitive nature of this mission, Nasara contacted an old friend, an Asian covert operations specialist.",
    "meta_cup_goldcup-frontgate_description": "We're going for the gold of the King of Rockay City and nobody can stop us. We bust through the gold depot's main entrance.",
    "meta_cup_goldcup-basement_description": "We're going for the gold of the King of Rockay City. Hidden in the shipment to the gold depot, we infiltrate the basement and no one will suspect a thing.",
    "meta_cup_buzzsaws_description": "When the hell breaks loose in the gold depot, having a few more buzzsaws as a backup or for extra power could be the difference between success and failure.",
    "meta_cup_buzzsaws_title": "Whirling Speed"
