    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkKilled_3_1": "I hope people learned the lesson from this.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkNothing_1_1": "I just came from a call from our loan shark friend. To say he�s displeased would be an understatement. He wants his money yesterday.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_TradePreciousMetalBrief_1_1": "I like your style, how to change lead to gold and silver.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken2KhanWin_2_1": "I love it! Time to hit Khan, when he's weaker than a little baby lizard.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkEffect_ResultA_2_1": "I think it�s a better decision in the long run. We don�t need more headaches at this stage.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkInvestigation_4_1": "I think this is it from him for the time being, but it looks like we�ll have to deal with Sheriff�s investigation sooner than we thought.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_StrengthenArmy1Done_ResultC_2_1": "I trust my supplier, because they know better than to fuck with me.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken2DollarDragonBrief_1_1": "I want to bring Dragon�s army to their knees. How can we do that?",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken1KhanFail_1_1": "I wanted the head of Riders' captain. Where is it?",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_TradeLuxuriesBrief_4_1": "I will arrange the trade when we have enough to catch attention of other parties.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken1HieloBrief_3_1": "I will send someone.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkIntro_ResultB_1_1": "I won�t be kissing feet of any loan shark. It�s just a minor setback, and I can get us through.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_BribeCopsBriefShort_ResultB_1_1": "I'm not made of fuckin' money am I? Hold that thought, because now is not a good time�",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken2DollarDragonBrief_2_1": "I'm tracking the movements of his guys right now, we're gonna see where it leads us. And then, boom, boom, boom! A barrage of strategic moves!",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkNoPay_2_1": "I'm warning you, Travis. Don't mess with this guy. I'll try to get us more time, but he and his cronies are serious.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_StrengthenArmy1Done_ResultC_1_1": "I've got your man a big 'ol mountain of coke. And he better not snort his head off, before he gives us what he owes!",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkEffect_ResultC_1_1": "If he thinks he can blackmail us, he�s got another thing coming.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkNothing_ResultC_1_1": "If he thinks he can blackmail us, he�s got another thing coming.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_TradeDrugsBrief_4_1": "If we get enough drugs, we can sell them for much higher price than on the Black market.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_ExpansionBrief2_1_1": "If you wanna be the King, one turf ain�t enough. We gotta take it all.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_InvestigationBrief_4_1": "Investing in a few officers will lead to lost evidence, diverted attention and witness silencing. Difficult to prosecute with nothing to build a case on.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkEffect_ResultB_2_1": "It is a big sum of money that we owe him.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3HieloWin_1_1": "It worked, chief. Hielo's army is weak as hell, right now�",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_StrengthenArmy1Done_ResultB_1_1": "It's not the right time. I'll hand onto my cash for now.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_PettyCrimesBrief_1_1": "It's time to increase our earnings.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_TradeDrugsBrief_3_1": "It�s not a problem, it's an opportunity.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkKilled_1_1": "I�ll have you know, a certain money-grubbing friend of ours was found dead on the street.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkIntro_2_1": "I�ve contacted a guy. A little on the dangerous side, but with enough resources to make our financial troubles disappear for a while.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_BribeCopsBrief_5_1": "I�ve spoken with Gloves. Investing in a few key officers will extend the response times and limit numbers. Your thoughts?",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3KhanBrief_1_1": "Khan is one goddamn tough son of a bitch!",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_BribeCopsBrief_ResultB_1_1": "Let's see how bad it is, before I decide to add fuckin' cops to my payroll.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_AttackHieloDone_2_1": "Let�s do it.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_TradeGemsBrief_4_1": "Let�s satiate that hunger, and also my wallet. I will get the dammed stones.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_ExpansionBrief2_2_1": "Let�s take a few turfs a day then. You got a lot of guys from Nasara.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_ExpansionBrief_2_1": "Let�s take a few turfs a day then. You got a lot of guys from Nasara.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkIntro_ResultA_2_1": "Let�s take the money, and make ten times more!",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken1DollarDragonFail_2_1": "Like I care. Next time we will not use amateurs for the job.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken2HieloFail_2_1": "Listen I see little ChickChicks everywhere! And they are happy�?!",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkIntro_1_1": "Look, the way things are going right now, our little kingdom will fall apart. And I�m sure you�re just as unwilling to let it happen.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken2HieloBrief_3_1": "Maybe with a touch of blowing shit up and a mowing down a few droves of men, I got a book of fun plays I'm drawing up�",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_StrengthenArmy1Done_ResultA_2_1": "More than worth it! Tomorrow, we'll be straight up fuckin' murder machines.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_AttackKhanFail_1_1": "My fault chief. Goddamn Khan is stronger than I figured� We're gonna have to lick our wounds, and hit the field again.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_StrenthenArmy2Done_ResultB_1_1": "Nah, I need them now.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_StrengthenArmy1Brief_5_1": "Nah, man, Rockay's a weapons paradise! But the price ain't no bargain.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Respect2Done_2_1": "No amateurs anymore.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_TradeElectronicsBrief_3_1": "No silly, we will sell big pile of them to a trader.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Respect4Brief_2_1": "No time to waste, let�s finish this.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_TradeLuxuriesBrief_1_1": "Not everyone gets to enjoy the luxuries, like we do.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Respect4Done_2_1": "Not for fuckin' long� Soon I'll be the King.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3KhanFail_1_1": "Not good... Khan held strong. Motherfucker blocked our every move.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_Respect1Brief_2_1": "Not just by Rockay PD, but also by criminal underworld.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_Respect2Brief_2_1": "Not only from his crew and people, but also from other entities in the city.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_Respect4Done_1_1": "Now you are the true Crime Boss. Only King�s position is higher than this.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_OpportunitiesHeistersHired_2_1": "Observe the map. There are opportunities present.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3KhanWin_2_1": "Oh yes, you bet your ass he is! Because now we will fuckin' end him�",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_TradeAntiquesBrief_4_1": "Oh, okay. We will get that stuff and sell it to them, right?",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_BribeCopsBriefShort_ResultA_1_1": "Okay then, but I better not see one fuckin' SWAT, next time I take a little stroll into the city.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_StrengthenArmy1Done_ResultB_2_1": "Okay, your call. But our guys will be sittin' ducks out there when the other gangs gear up.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_TradeDrugsBrief_2_1": "Okay. And how is that my problem?",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_PettyCrimesWonSome_2_1": "Once the art of heisting is perfected a new warehouse will be required for our earnings.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_ExpansionBrief_1_1": "One turf ain't diddly-squat man! You wanna be the king, we gotta take it all.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_TradePreciousMetalBrief_3_1": "Or they just were missing guns. It�s time to put your magic to use in finances.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_PettyCrimesWonSome_1_1": "Our assets are increasing, yet there is ample room for growth.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkEffect_1_1": "Our loan shark friend no longer plays nice and upped the pressure on us. I�ll give you a summary of the damages, but first thing first � should we repay the dept?",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_TradeAntiquesBrief_1_1": "Paintings, old coins, old vases, people buy everything old� and valuable.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_ExpansionAlreadyDone_3_1": "Patience, brother. We gotta play defense against the other gangs, while avoiding the fucking cops.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkPay_ResultA_1_1": "Pay him. I hope I won�t need that vulture�s services any more.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_ExpansionBrief_4_1": "Plus, you ain't the only one gunnin' for the throne! The only limit to protecting our territory, is manpower.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_ExpansionBrief2_3_1": "Priority one - Protect our own turf. You ain't the only want aiming to be the King. Lucky for us the neutral turf should be a sinch to capture.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_PettyCrimesLost_3_1": "Quiet the disappointment. They claimed to be professionals.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_PettyCrimesLost_2_1": "Quite a pile of bodies� And not a single dime from it.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_TradeLuxuriesBrief_3_1": "Quite the opposite. We can sell the luxuries we have to someone else.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_Respect2Brief_1_1": "Respect is a thing which every Boss should have.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken2KhanFail_1_1": "Riders are goddamn pissed about our moves. They're swearing revenge.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken2KhanBrief_1_1": "Riders are some tough sons of fuckin' bitches. We gotta soften them up, before we attack.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_TradeDrugsBrief_1_1": "Rockay dealers are missing a lot of products after King�s party. They are desperate.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_AttackHieloBrief_2_1": "Saddle up, cowboy! We can't let this fuckin' chance pass by.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3KhanBrief_4_1": "Send some fuckin' rough ends in, seek and destroy, target his captain and supply location. We do that shit, he's in deep fuckin' shit!",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkPay_ResultA_2_1": "So do I, Boss.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_InvestigationBrief_2_1": "So what do we do? Take out the detectives?",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_StrengthenArmy1Done_1_1": "So you ready to level up the gear? Give me the scratch and I'll handle the rest chief!",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_TradeElectronicsBrief_2_1": "So, we're gonna buy a factory?",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_AttackHieloFail_1_1": "Son of a bitch! That info about Hielos? Gotta be bullshit - we got casualties�",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_ExpansionDone_2_1": "Soon, we'll own every-fuckin'-thing. Including, a real football field - I promise you that.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3HieloBrief_3_1": "Sounds good. Figure it out, and I will send the people to do it.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkIntro_ResultA_3_1": "Sounds like a plan.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3DollarDragonWin_2_1": "Splendid. Start the offensive, right now!",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_StrengthenArmy2Brief_4_1": "Still gonna have to grease his palms up pretty good.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3KhanBrief_3_1": "Sure we are. But we can help ourselves out by softening him up before the fight.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3HieloBrief_2_1": "Sure! We can open up and mow down his troops, blitz in and snatch his shit, and then search and destroy his captain. Sound good to you?",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_StrenthenArmy2Done_ResultA_1_1": "Sure. Take the cash and make it happen.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_BribeCopsBrief_ResultA_1_1": "Take care of it! Dealing with gangs is bad enough� I don't want the cops on my ass, every time I fuckin' sneeze in the city.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3HieloFail_2_1": "Tell me something I don't fuckin' know!",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3KhanFail_2_1": "That cunt face! I'll rip his heart out with my bare hands!",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken1KhanWin_2_1": "That means less of them here, great. Attack Khan, crush him.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_InvestigationKillDone_1_1": "That should suffice... Perhaps now the message to mind your own, is clear.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_PettyCrimesLost_1_1": "That was unfortunate.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken1DollarDragonBrief_3_1": "That would be good. But... no no no, I found a way to weaken Dragon's troops. There's a squad of gangsters, gonna meet up with this guy who handles parts of his business.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken1KhanBrief_3_1": "The Riders, they're doing a little biker rally. Let's roll our asses over there.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_InvestigationBrief_1_1": "The Sheriff has detained an asset I wish to recruit. His focus upon us is disruptive; we are met by detectives even as we approach a target. Gloves, is understandably distressed.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_BribeCopsBriefShort_1_1": "The authorities have become troublesome. Gloves suggest investing in a few key officers to reduce this investigation.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkInvestigation_2_1": "The loan shark is livid. He spews vitriol on our little operation everywhere he goes, so I doubt we�ll get another loan for quite a while.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_StrengthenArmy1Brief_1_1": "The pirates crews are ready to rumble! We gotta set 'em up with some better gear though.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkIntro_5_1": "Then again, once we take the deal, we should expect him to come hard after his money when the time comes to pay.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_OpportunitiesBrief_1_1": "There are more opportunities but we must be certain to fill our roster, so the jobs can be completed.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_TradeAntiquesBrief_3_1": "There is a lot dealers with antique items in Rockay.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_ExpansionDone_1_1": "There we go! Finally, our fuckin' turf is bigger than a football field!",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_StrenthenArmy2Done_ResultB_3_1": "Think it over and check back with me later.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_InvestigationKillFailed_1_1": "This did not help the matter. Now the witness is beyond our reach and the authorities will be more aggressive.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkInvestigation_1_1": "This is bad news, so I�ll cut to the chase.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_OpportunitiesDone_1_1": "This was merely a taste. More opportunities will appear each day.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Respect3Brief_3_1": "Those fuckers are gonna be shakin' in their boots.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_ExpansionAlreadyDone_1_1": "Those pirates are absolute fuckin' beasts! With this squad, we'll take the fuckin' city in no time!",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3DollarDragonBrief_4_1": "Time to burn the Dragon!",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_Respect3Brief_1_1": "Time to instill fear through our power and respect.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_StrenthenArmy2Done_1_1": "Time to say 'adios', to the dinero.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3HieloWin_2_1": "Tonight, my friend, the drinks are on me! Tomorrow, we conquer the fuckin' world!",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3HieloBrief_1_1": "Touchdown, I need to take Hielo out at the knees. Any ideas?",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_TradeDealFailed_1_1": "Trade didn�t go exactly as planned. We did not close the deal.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_ExpansionAlreadyDone_5_1": "Trust me, man. We'll be bustin' our fuckin' asses, just to protect our own turf. We gotta retaliate against as many attacks a day - as we can - if we got the troops that is.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_TradeDealDone_2_1": "Try to hold some loot if possible, you never know what the good people of Rockay will demand next.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_BribeCopsBrief_ResultB_2_1": "Understood, we�ll table this for now.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_StrengthenArmy1Brief_6_1": "Unless�?",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_BribeCopsBrief_ResultA_2_1": "Very well. You can expect a quick turnaround on this investment.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_Respect3Brief_2_1": "We are getting closer to becoming the most powerful in the city.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_Respect3Done_1_1": "We are now one of the biggest forces in the city. We are now rivaled only by few.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkIntro_ResultA_1_1": "We can worry about that in the future. The problems we have are now.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_Respect1Done_1_1": "We did it Baker, we are now connected to the criminal underworld. We are now taken more seriously.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_Respect2Done_1_1": "We have just earned our respect. We will �now get more interesting people and jobs.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_AttackKhanDone_1_1": "We knocked fuckin' Khans ass back! Now let's pile the fuck on, while he's licking his wounds.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_StrengthenArmy2Brief_3_1": "We loot a warehouse. I can arrange it; inside guy.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3HieloFail_3_1": "We lost a fuck ton! And Hielo's having the last chuckle! Fuck, I hate him�",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_InvestigationBrief_3_1": "We need to stifle this investigation.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_ExpansionBrief_3_1": "We run our offense like that, we're gonna have pigs all the fuckin' over us. One turf at a time chief.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken1DollarDragonBrief_4_1": "We send some fuckin' heavy hitters in, smoke the motherfucker who looks good. This hits him in the wallet and leaves his troops vulnerable for a minute, or two.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken1KhanBrief_5_1": "We're gonna send his guys a message: We can pick your fuckin' ass off, anywhere, anytime!",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3KhanBrief_2_1": "We're stronger.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_StrengthenArmy1Brief_8_1": "Well how- how strong a habit are we talking about exactly? Because, you know, I've heard - you get more miles when you do your piles.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken1DollarDragonFail_1_1": "Well that got the Dragon royally pissed-fuckin'-off�",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_TradeLuxuriesBrief_2_1": "Well, if I didn't know you, I would say: This leads to charity.",
    "TheHand_ID_CUTguide_PettyCrimesWonAll_1_1": "We�ve found our rhythm. Now, smaller establishments pose no difficulty.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken2DollarDragonWin_2_1": "What are you waiting for?! Take your knights and slay that princess muncher!",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_StrengthenArmy2Brief_2_1": "What do you have in mind?",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_StrengthenArmy1Brief_2_1": "What do you mean? We go through turfs like� A knife through butter!",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_StrengthenArmy2Brief_5_1": "What good is a King, without a fuckin' army? Now let's do it.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken1HieloFail_2_1": "What in the holy fuck happened?! He's off the radar man, we missed our shot!",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3DollarDragonFail_2_1": "What the fuck about it?",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken2HieloFail_1_1": "What the fuck, Touchdown?",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken2DollarDragonFail_2_1": "Whatever! We will just kill them all and problem is solved!",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkEffect_ResultB_3_1": "Which is the only reason why he�s not already at the bottom of the harbor with some nice new cement shoes.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkNoPay_3_1": "Who is this guy, anyway? I don�t need another competitor in the city.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3KhanWin_1_1": "Woah-ho, chief! Khan is in a world of fuckin' shit!",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken3DollarDragonWin_1_1": "Woohohoo! The fuckin' dildo Dragon's now weak as fuck!",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken2HieloWin_1_1": "Woohoo! Ya! Just got wind the Chikos are in goddamn chaos after our move.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken1KhanBrief_4_1": "Word is, some head honcho is gonna be there, yeah? Maybe even, Khans captain.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_AttackKhanDone_2_1": "Yeah! Smash him - to the fucking ground!",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken2HieloBrief_4_1": "Yeah, Hielos army will be weak as a baby after this.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_guide_Weaken1HieloFail_2_1": "Yeah, I am surprised too. Well, he went off the radar. We missed this chance.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Weaken2HieloBrief_2_1": "Yeah, I like that. So robbing some of his resources and killing one dude can do all of that?",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_TradePreciousMetalBrief_2_1": "Yeah, alchemists were pussies.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken2HieloFail_3_1": "Yeah, the play was a bust. That's on me, chief.",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Respect2Brief_3_1": "Yeah, yeah, a will just to get more turfs, right?",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_Respect3Done_2_1": "Yes! I can already feel the crown - on my fingertips.",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken2KhanBrief_3_1": "You know the drill. Turn the fuckin' screws! Make him scramble for gas while I'm bleeding his teams! Let's watch that bastard try to save face�",
    "TravisBaker_ID_CUTguide_TradeAntiquesBrief_2_1": "You know, honey, you had me at 'valuable'. What do you have in mind?",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_Weaken2HieloBrief_1_1": "You take a look at the play I drew up?",
    "TheCaptain_ID_CUTguide_StrengthenArmy1Brief_9_1": "You�ll see.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_TradePreciousMetalBrief_4_1": "�Transmute� more lead to precious metals, and we will sell it to the highest bidder.",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_LoansharkKilled_4_1": "�What would be the lesson, sir?",
    "Casey_ID_CUTguide_TradeGemsBrief_3_1": "�Yes. Other gems has also worth, and there are a few dealers, hungry for stones."
  },
  "ST_CUThie_Variations": {
    "MacPlanner_ID_CUThie_HieloKilled_3_1": "(singing) Body Count�s in the house... Body Count.",
    "MacPlanner_ID_CUThie_SaveMacBrief_2_1": "Bad news: Hielo�s got an� incriminating tape of me. I�ll be diced up, put in a suitcase, and thrown in the harbor if it gets out.",
    "MacPlanner_ID_CUThie_SaveMacBriefFirst_4_1": "Don�t be late.",
    "MacPlanner_ID_CUThie_CarStealerDoneWithCar_1_1": "Exactly as planned! Couldn�t have dreamt it better!",
    "MacPlanner_ID_CUThie_SaveMacBrief_3_1": "Good news: I know how to get it back and, on top of that, I got the deets on his next concert.",
    "MacPlanner_ID_CUThie_CarStealerDoneWithCar_3_1": "Hah, and the best part is, he�ll be too distracted to see what�s coming next.",
